## Documentation Location

- **Features:** `docs/features/{{ISSUE_ID}}-FEATURE-NAME/`
- **Fixes:** `docs/fixes/` (monthly logs or complex fix folders)
- **Architecture:** `docs/architecture/` (ADRs)
- **API:** `docs/api/`
- **User-facing docs site:** `apps/docs/content/docs/`

## Per-App Obligations

| App          | Change type                      | Required doc action                                               |
| ------------ | -------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `apps/api`   | New or modified controller/route | Update `docs/api/` **and** `apps/docs/content/docs/`              |
| `apps/api`   | Breaking change                  | Update `docs/api/`, `apps/docs/content/docs/`, and `CHANGELOG.md` |
| `apps/api`   | New module / service             | Add to `docs/features/` feature spec                              |
| `apps/admin` | New route handler                | Update relevant feature spec                                      |
| `apps/admin` | New user-facing page             | Update `docs/features/` and `apps/docs/content/docs/`             |
| `apps/web`   | New user-facing page             | Update `docs/features/` and `apps/docs/content/docs/`             |
| `apps/docs`  | Content-only edits (MDX)         | No extra docs — this edit _is_ the documentation update           |
| `packages/*` | New or changed public API        | Update `docs/api/` and `apps/docs/content/docs/`                  |

## Feature Documentation

Create for new features, API endpoints, architectural changes:

```
docs/features/NAPX-123-feature-name/
├── spec.md    # Functional specification
├── plan.md    # Implementation plan
└── [optional] # Diagrams, examples
```

## Fix Documentation

**Simple fixes:** Add to monthly log `docs/fixes/YYYY-MM.md`

**Complex fixes:** Create folder `docs/fixes/NAPX-123-FIX-NAME/`

## Pre-Commit Documentation Gate

⚠️ Documentation MUST be written or updated BEFORE committing. This is mandatory.

**All changes:**

- [ ] Feature spec (`docs/features/`) exists and reflects current implementation
- [ ] Fix entry added to `docs/fixes/YYYY-MM.md` or complex fix folder created
- [ ] `CHANGELOG.md` updated for breaking changes
- [ ] ADR created in `docs/architecture/` for significant decisions

**`apps/api` changes:**

- [ ] `docs/api/` updated with endpoint spec (method, path, auth, request/response, errors)
- [ ] `apps/docs/content/docs/` page created or updated
- [ ] Breaking changes noted in `docs/api/`, `apps/docs/content/docs/`, and `CHANGELOG.md`

**`apps/admin` or `apps/web` changes:**

- [ ] User-facing features have a page in `apps/docs/content/docs/`
- [ ] Cross-app or public API routes documented in `docs/api/`

**`packages/*` changes:**

- [ ] Public exports documented in `docs/api/` or feature spec
- [ ] `apps/docs/content/docs/` updated if developer-facing

**`apps/docs` changes:**

- [ ] No extra docs required — the MDX edit itself is the documentation update

If any applicable item is missing, **write the documentation first, then commit**.

## Commit References

Reference documentation in commits:

```
feat(feature): implement X

See docs/features/NAPX-123-feature-name/ for details
Closes NAPX-123
```

## Templates

Use templates from `templates/` directory:

- `feature-spec.template.md`
- `feature-plan.template.md`
- `monthly-fix-log.template.md`
- `adr.template.md`
